    category: 'general',
    setup: 'An outcast from a neighboring settlement — exiled for a crime that may or may not have been committed — approaches {agent.name} with an offer: knowledge. The outcast knows where a hidden cache of supplies is buried (left by a previous exile), the location of a safe pass through the eastern mountains (known only to smugglers), and the name of a contact in the coastal cities who trades in rare goods. The price: {agent.name}\'s word that the outcast can shelter in {agent.location} for the winter.',
