    category: 'general',
    setup: 'A horse trader brings a single animal to {agent.location}: a horse of exceptional lineage, beautiful and furious, that has thrown every rider who has attempted to mount it. The trader will sell it at a steep discount because he cannot use it. {agent.name} watches the horse and sees something the others don\'t: the horse isn\'t vicious. It is *particular*. It is choosing, and nobody has been chosen.',
